2. For the purpose of section 42(2)(d) of the Act, a member of the Fund is not insured under the Scheme if no contribution paid into the Fund for that member (before, on or after 1 January 2020) is or was a contribution payable under any of the following provisions:
(a)section 7 of the Act in respect of that member’s wages;
(b)section 8A of the Act in respect of that member’s platform remuneration;
(c)section 9A of the Act in respect of that member’s income;
(d)section 9B of the Act in respect of any revenue payment to that member.
